WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Your shows, your movies, your anime, they're already on your drives.

00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
CineShelf turns those folders into a library that feels like a streaming service.

00:12.000 --> 00:19.000
Every series gets its artwork, seasons, and cast, and it remembers exactly where you stopped.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.000
Movies get their own home, with shelves you arrange yourself.

00:24.000 --> 00:31.000
Anime knows which episodes are canon and which are filler, so you can go straight to the story.

00:31.000 --> 00:34.000
Browse all of it at once.

00:34.000 --> 00:40.000
Press Play, and a real VLC player opens under CineShelf's own controls.

00:40.000 --> 00:45.000
Tracks, subtitles, and the next episode are one click away.

00:45.000 --> 00:48.000
It runs entirely offline on your own files.

00:48.000 --> 00:52.000
No account, no subscription.

00:52.000 --> 00:56.000
CineShelf, try the demo in your browser.

